                        "name":  "places/ChIJlxJ_aYWrQjQREGdqLotZiBo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCRlpVeHZPV3M1YUZkQ2NYUjVWVmRRT0d3dFMxRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "2 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "1️⃣ The rice balls (rice balls) have a great texture.\n\nMany reviews mention:\n\n• The rice grains are distinct, warm but not sticky.\n\n• The seaweed aroma is pronounced.\n\n• The overall texture is like a combination of \"Japanese rice ball + hamburger.\"\n\nCommon review types:\n\n\"The rice has a great texture, not too soft, and it\u0027s very fragrant with seaweed.\"\n\n\"It\u0027s better than I expected, like a rice ball version of a hamburger.\"\n\n⸻\n\n2️⃣ The toppings are generous and layered.\n\nAs you can see in the photo, many people mention:\n\n• The tamagoyaki (Japanese rolled omelet) is thick.\n\n• The meat or fried food portion is generous.\n\n• It has a layered flavor.\n\nCommon reviews:\n\n\"The tamagoyaki is very thick and tender.\"\n\n\"There are a lot of toppings; one is actually quite filling.\"\n\n⸻\n\n3️⃣ The mentaiko (spicy cod roe) series is very popular.\n\nThe mentaiko flavor you ordered is one of the most popular flavors.\n\nNetizens often say:\n\n• Mentaiko (spicy and savory) – just the right amount of salty and savory.\n\n• A slightly seared flavor.\n\n• Not too greasy.\n\nCommon comments:\n\n\"The seared mentaiko is very fragrant and goes well with rice.\"\n\n\"The mentaiko isn\u0027t too salty; the proportions are just right.\"\n\n⸻\n\n4️⃣ Japanese Fried Chicken – Delicious!\n\nThe other dish you ordered is also popular.\n\nComments often mention:\n\n• Crispy skin\n\n• Juicy chicken\n\n• Not too oily\n\nCommon comments:\n\n\"The fried chicken is delicious, crispy on the outside and tender on the inside.\"\n\n\"Fried chicken goes well with rice balls.\"\n\n⸻\n\n5️⃣ Set Meals – Good Value for Money\n\nMany people order the set meals (drink + fries).",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "1️⃣ 飯糰（飯丸）口感很好\n\n很多評論會提到：\n•\t米飯粒粒分明、溫熱但不黏\n•\t海苔香氣明顯\n•\t整體口感像 「日式飯糰＋漢堡」的結合\n\n常見評論類型：\n\n「米飯口感很好，不會過軟，配海苔很香。」\n「比想像中好吃，像飯糰版漢堡。」\n\n⸻\n\n2️⃣ 配料很厚實、層次感好\n\n你照片裡也看得出來，很多人都提到：\n•\t玉子燒厚\n•\t肉或炸物份量足\n•\t吃起來有層次\n\n常見評論：\n\n「玉子燒很厚很嫩。」\n「料很多，一個其實蠻有飽足感。」\n\n⸻\n\n3️⃣ 明太子系列很受歡迎\n\n你點的 明太子算熱門口味之一。\n\n網友常說：\n•\t明太子 鹹香剛好\n•\t有點微炙燒味道\n•\t不會過膩\n\n常見評論：\n\n「明太子炙燒味很香，配飯很搭。」\n「明太子不會太鹹，比例抓得很好。」\n\n⸻\n\n4️⃣ 日式炸雞口味不錯\n\n你點的另一個也是熱門。\n\n評論常提：\n•\t外皮酥脆\n•\t雞肉多汁\n•\t不會太油\n\n常見評論：\n\n「炸雞很好吃，外酥內嫩。」\n「炸雞配飯糰很搭。」\n\n⸻\n\n5️⃣ 套餐 CP值不錯\n\n很多人點 套餐（飲料＋薯條）。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
